    "Cartouche is running from Downloads. Move it to Applications, so permissions and updates stay with it. It relaunches from there." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Cartouche est ouvert depuis Téléchargements. Déplacez-le dans Applications pour conserver ses autorisations et recevoir les mises à jour. Il se relancera depuis ce dossier."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Cartouche è in esecuzione da Download. Spostalo in Applicazioni, così permessi e aggiornamenti restano con lui. Si riapre da lì."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Cartouche 正在从“下载”运行。请将其移到“应用程序”，这样权限和更新会随之保留。它会从那里重新打开。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Cartouche is running from the disk image. Move it to Applications, so permissions and updates stay with it. It relaunches from there." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
