            "value" : "它会将 CrossOver 使用的 DLL 替换为与当前兼容工具匹配的版本。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Its %lld games are hidden and their files stay on disk." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "fr" : {
          "variations" : {
            "plural" : {
