          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "其模拟器文件将移到废纸篓：%1$@。其 %2$lld 个游戏将被隐藏，文件保留在磁盘上。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Its emulator files move to the Trash: %@. Its game is hidden and its file stays on disk." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Les fichiers de son émulateur sont placés dans la Corbeille : %@. Son jeu est masqué et son fichier reste sur le disque."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "I file dell’emulatore vengono spostati nel Cestino: %@. Il suo gioco viene nascosto e il file resta sul disco."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "其模拟器文件将移到废纸篓：%@。其游戏将被隐藏，文件保留在磁盘上。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Its files and its prefix are deleted. Cloud saves stay with the store." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "fr" : {
