          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Steam Play, the free runner, consoles, game folders and privacy, as on the first launch." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Steam Play, la version gratuite de Wine, les consoles, les dossiers de jeux et la confidentialité, comme au premier lancement."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Steam Play, il runner gratuito, le console, le cartelle dei giochi e la privacy, come al primo avvio."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Steam Play、免费运行器、主机、游戏文件夹和隐私，与首次启动时相同。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Steam Settings…" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Réglages > Steam…"
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Impostazioni di Steam…"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Steam 设置…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Steam already loads another tool's dylib (%@). Cartouche leaves it in place. Remove that tool from Steam, then install again." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Steam charge déjà la dylib d’un autre outil (%@). Cartouche la laisse en place. Retirez cet outil de Steam, puis installez à nouveau."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Steam carica già la dylib di un altro strumento (%@). Cartouche la lascia al suo posto. Rimuovi quello strumento da Steam, poi installa di nuovo."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Steam 已加载另一个工具的 dylib（%@）。Cartouche 不会改动它。请从 Steam 中移除该工具，然后重新安装。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Steam also loads another tool's dylib (%@). Repair Steam would remove it, so Steam was left as it is. Remove that tool from Steam first." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Steam charge aussi la dylib d’un autre outil (%@). Réparer Steam la supprimerait, Steam a donc été laissé tel quel. Retirez d’abord cet outil de Steam."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Steam carica anche la dylib di un altro strumento (%@). Ripara Steam la rimuoverebbe, quindi Steam è stato lasciato com'è. Rimuovi prima quello strumento da Steam."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Steam 还加载了另一个工具的 dylib（%@）。修复 Steam 会将其移除，因此 Steam 保持不变。请先从 Steam 中移除该工具。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Steam asks before it removes what was downloaded" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Steam demande avant de supprimer ce qui a été téléchargé"
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Steam chiede conferma prima di eliminare ciò che è stato scaricato"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Steam 会在删除已下载内容前询问"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Steam at %@ isn't connected, so Cartouche can't be removed from it. All other Cartouche data is removed, except for your games, prefixes, console saves and BIOS files." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Steam dans %@ n’est pas connecté, Cartouche ne peut donc pas en être retiré. Toutes les autres données de Cartouche sont supprimées, sauf vos jeux, préfixes, sauvegardes console et fichiers BIOS."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Steam in %@ non è collegato, quindi Cartouche non può esserne rimosso. Tutti gli altri dati di Cartouche vengono rimossi, tranne i tuoi giochi, i prefissi, i salvataggi delle console e i file BIOS."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "位于 %@ 的 Steam 未连接，因此无法从中移除 Cartouche。其他所有 Cartouche 数据都会被移除，但你的游戏、游戏容器、主机存档和 BIOS 文件除外。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Steam at %@ isn't connected." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Steam dans %@ n’est pas connecté."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Steam in %@ non è collegato."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "位于 %@ 的 Steam 未连接。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Steam can't read controllers. Allow Steam in Accessibility in System Settings." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Steam ne peut pas détecter les manettes. Autorisez-le dans Réglages Système > Confidentialité et sécurité > Accessibilité."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Steam non può leggere i controller. Consenti Steam in Accessibilità nelle Impostazioni di Sistema."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Steam 无法读取手柄。请在系统设置的“辅助功能”中允许 Steam。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Steam client updates are allowed." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Les mises à jour du client Steam sont autorisées."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Gli aggiornamenti del client Steam sono consentiti."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "已允许 Steam 客户端更新。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Steam client updates are blocked." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Les mises à jour du client Steam sont bloquées."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Gli aggiornamenti del client Steam sono bloccati."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "已阻止 Steam 客户端更新。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Steam client updates may break Cartouche." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Les mises à jour du client Steam peuvent empêcher Cartouche de fonctionner."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Gli aggiornamenti del client Steam potrebbero rendere Cartouche inutilizzabile."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Steam 客户端更新可能导致 Cartouche 无法使用。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Steam client updates may break Cartouche. If you don't want to wait for Cartouche to be updated to be compatible with future Steam versions at the cost of not getting updates to the Steam client, you can stop the Steam client from updating itself." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Les mises à jour de Steam peuvent empêcher Cartouche de fonctionner, le temps qu’une version compatible soit disponible. Vous pouvez bloquer ces mises à jour pour éviter cette interruption. En contrepartie, vous ne recevrez plus les nouveautés ni les correctifs de Steam."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Gli aggiornamenti del client Steam potrebbero rendere Cartouche inutilizzabile. Se non vuoi aspettare che Cartouche venga aggiornato per le future versioni di Steam, puoi impedire al client Steam di aggiornarsi, rinunciando però ai suoi aggiornamenti."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Steam 客户端更新可能导致 Cartouche 无法使用。你可以阻止 Steam 自动更新，避免等待 Cartouche 适配新版本，但这也意味着无法及时获得 Steam 客户端的功能改进和安全更新。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Steam closes while Cartouche updates its files. Open Steam again when Cartouche is done." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Steam se ferme pendant que Cartouche met à jour ses fichiers. Rouvrez Steam quand Cartouche a terminé."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Steam si chiude mentre Cartouche aggiorna i suoi file. Riapri Steam quando Cartouche ha finito."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Cartouche 更新其文件时 Steam 会关闭。Cartouche 完成后请重新打开 Steam。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Steam could not be found. Choose or install Steam in Settings." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Steam est introuvable. Choisissez son emplacement ou installez-le dans Réglages > Steam."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Steam non è stato trovato. Scegli o installa Steam nelle impostazioni."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "找不到 Steam。请在设置中选择或安装 Steam。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Steam could not be fully restored. Please run Repair Steam again." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Steam n’a pas pu être entièrement restauré. Relancez Réparer Steam."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Non è stato possibile ripristinare completamente Steam. Esegui di nuovo Ripara Steam."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "未能完全恢复 Steam。请再次执行“修复 Steam”。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Steam could not be installed: %@" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Steam n’a pas pu être installé : %@"
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Impossibile installare Steam: %@"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "无法安装 Steam：%@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Steam could not be opened" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Impossible d’ouvrir Steam"
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Impossibile aprire Steam"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "无法打开 Steam"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Steam did not answer. Check that it is signed in and update the Steam integration in Settings." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Steam ne répond pas. Vérifiez la connexion et mettez à jour l’intégration Steam dans les réglages."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Steam non risponde. Verifica l’accesso e aggiorna l’integrazione Steam nelle impostazioni."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Steam 未响应。请确认已登录，并在设置中更新 Steam 集成。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Steam downloads the Windows version and runs it with Steam Play. Useful when the Mac port lags behind." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Steam télécharge la version Windows et la lance avec Steam Play. Utile si la version Mac n’est plus à jour."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Steam scarica la versione Windows e la esegue con Steam Play. Utile quando la versione per Mac è in ritardo."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Steam 会下载 Windows 版本并通过 Steam Play 运行。适用于 Mac 版更新滞后的情况。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Steam finished downloading it." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Steam a fini de le télécharger."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Steam ha terminato il download."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Steam 已下载完成。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Steam games still run." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Les jeux Steam fonctionnent toujours."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "I giochi Steam si avviano comunque."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Steam 游戏仍可运行。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Steam has a Cartouche build that this app did not install. Repair installs this app’s build." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Steam contient une version de Cartouche que cette app n’a pas installée. Réparer installe la version de cette app."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Steam contiene una build di Cartouche non installata da questa app. Ripara installa la build di questa app."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Steam 中的 Cartouche 版本并非由此应用安装。修复会安装此应用的版本。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Steam has a different copy of Cartouche, installed by another account on this Mac. Update Cartouche from that account, then try again." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Steam contient une autre copie de Cartouche, installée par un autre compte sur ce Mac. Mettez Cartouche à jour depuis ce compte, puis réessayez."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Steam ha una copia diversa di Cartouche, installata da un altro account su questo Mac. Aggiorna Cartouche da quell'account, poi riprova."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Steam 中的另一份 Cartouche 是由本机其他账户安装的。请使用该账户更新 Cartouche，然后重试。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Steam has a newer Cartouche build. Use the Cartouche app that installed it." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Steam dispose d’une version plus récente de Cartouche. Utilisez l’app Cartouche qui l’a installée."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Steam ha una versione più recente di Cartouche. Usa l’app Cartouche con cui è stata installata."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Steam 中的 Cartouche 版本较新。请使用安装该版本的 Cartouche 应用。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Steam has not been set up for Cartouche, and this account cannot change it. Install from the account that owns Steam." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Steam n’a pas été configuré pour Cartouche, et ce compte ne peut pas le modifier. Installez depuis le compte qui possède Steam."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Steam non è stato configurato per Cartouche e questo account non può modificarlo. Installa dall'account a cui appartiene Steam."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Steam 尚未配置 Cartouche，当前账户无权修改。请使用安装 Steam 的账户执行安装。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Steam integration needs repair." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "L’intégration à Steam doit être réparée."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "L'integrazione con Steam va riparata."
          }
        },
