          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Steam 集成需要修复。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Steam is already in %@." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Steam est déjà dans %@."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Steam è già in %@."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Steam 已在 %@ 中。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Steam is closed. Some details may be out of date." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Steam est fermé. Certains détails peuvent ne pas être à jour."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Steam è chiuso. Alcuni dettagli potrebbero non essere aggiornati."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Steam 已关闭。部分信息可能不是最新。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Steam is installed. Sign in once in Steam. Your library then shows up here, and Windows games run through Steam Play." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Steam est installé. Connectez-vous dans Steam pour retrouver votre bibliothèque ici et lancer vos jeux Windows avec Steam Play."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Steam è installato. Accedi una volta in Steam. La tua libreria comparirà qui e i giochi Windows girano tramite Steam Play."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Steam 已安装。请在 Steam 中登录一次。之后你的游戏库会显示在这里，Windows 游戏通过 Steam Play 运行。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Steam is not on this Mac. The Steam page of the library installs it." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Steam n’est pas installé sur ce Mac. Installez-le depuis la rubrique Steam de la bibliothèque."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Steam non è su questo Mac. La pagina Steam della libreria lo installa."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "这台 Mac 上没有 Steam。游戏库中的 Steam 页面可以安装它。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Steam is open, so the shortcut was not added. Quit Steam and install again to add it." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Steam est ouvert, le raccourci n’a donc pas été ajouté. Quittez Steam et installez à nouveau pour l’ajouter."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Steam è aperto, quindi il collegamento non è stato aggiunto. Esci da Steam e installa di nuovo per aggiungerlo."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Steam 正在运行，因此未添加快捷方式。请退出 Steam 后重新安装以添加。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Steam is restored to its unmodified state and Cartouche is removed, including the compatibility tool that lives inside the Steam folder. Your games, prefixes, console saves and BIOS files are not removed." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Steam retrouve son état d’origine. Cartouche et son outil de compatibilité sont retirés du dossier Steam. Vos jeux, préfixes, sauvegardes console et fichiers BIOS sont conservés."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Steam torna al suo stato originale e Cartouche viene rimosso, compreso lo strumento di compatibilità nella cartella di Steam. I tuoi giochi, i prefissi, i salvataggi delle console e i file BIOS non vengono rimossi."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Steam 会恢复到未修改的状态，Cartouche 会被移除，包括 Steam 文件夹中的兼容性工具。你的游戏、游戏容器、主机存档和 BIOS 文件不会被移除。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Steam is running, please close Steam." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Fermez Steam pour continuer."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Steam è in esecuzione, chiudi Steam."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Steam 正在运行，请先关闭 Steam。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Steam is set up to inject a different dylib. Please repair Steam before installing Cartouche." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Steam est configuré pour injecter une dylib différente. Veuillez réparer Steam avant d’installer Cartouche."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Steam è configurato per caricare una dylib diversa. Ripara Steam prima di installare Cartouche."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Steam 已配置为注入其他动态库。请先修复 Steam，再安装 Cartouche。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Steam is somewhere else" : {
