        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "该游戏的游戏容器不是其 Steam 游戏库中自有的目录。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The game’s files stay where they are. Its Wine prefix and Cartouche’s record of it move to the Trash, freeing %@." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Les fichiers du jeu restent à leur emplacement. Son préfixe Wine et ses informations dans Cartouche sont placés dans la Corbeille, ce qui libère %@."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "I file del gioco restano dove sono. Il suo prefisso Wine e la scheda di Cartouche vengono spostati nel Cestino, liberando %@."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "游戏文件保留在原处。其 Wine 前缀与 Cartouche 的记录将移到废纸篓，释放 %@。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The game’s fuel.json file is missing. Verify its files." : {
