    "Your Steam library needs the Mac version of Steam. Windows games then run through Steam Play, with the runners you set up here." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Votre bibliothèque Steam nécessite la version Mac de Steam. Les jeux Windows passent ensuite par Steam Play, avec les versions de Wine que vous configurez ici."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "La tua libreria Steam richiede la versione Mac di Steam. I giochi Windows girano poi tramite Steam Play, con i runner che configuri qui."
